# project docs and AI agent config
project.md
.github/

# Claude Code AI harness. The parts that DEFINE behaviour are tracked — settings, gates,
# agents and skills decide what "verified" means here, and a definition that can change
# without appearing in a diff is a suggestion rather than a gate. Everything else under
# .claude/ (runtime state, local overrides, plan artifacts) stays local.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/harness/
!.claude/lessons/
.claude/.harness/
CLAUDE.md
.env*
